        0,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "text": "One winter night in Japan, two woodcutters faced a snowstorm. Minokichi was eighteen and worked for the older man. They could not continue, so they entered a riverside hut. They shut the door with a bar. Both lay under straw coats, and his master soon slept. Snow touched Minokichi's face and woke him. The open door let in the storm. A woman in white bent over his master. In the pale light, her breath crossed his face like white smoke. The woman turned towards Minokichi. He wanted to get up, but his body stayed still. She brought her beautiful face close to his.",
      "text_sha256": "b7163c7ca44759ba506708c0a348d8ec4714757a46c60967b01dd1ba3142655a",
      "word_count": 103,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"I planned to kill you too,\"",
      "text_sha256": "79ef010cd5e082aa8cb7f867e6a446d2a8537bbd27460c5f4e4c68fa33d7b643",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "the woman whispered.",
      "text_sha256": "b42cafa567cda1249fee670724ca70cb1daa596ebe81f55a682654a0cbd6569e",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"But you can live because you are young. Never tell anyone about tonight, not even your mother. If you do, I will know and kill you. Do not forget.\"",
      "text_sha256": "2ede2053205bc6b0763fa0f0fdcf799378dc40700dc6b581ac048c73c36aa030",
      "word_count": 29,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4,
        5,
        6,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "text": "She left him and went back into the storm. He put the bar across the door again. His master's face felt cold as ice; the man was dead. Afterwards, Minokichi told nobody, not even about his master's death. The next winter, Minokichi met a beautiful girl called Yuki. Her skin was white, and she spoke in a gentle voice. He took her home to his mother, whose husband had died. His mother welcomed Yuki and talked her into staying. Yuki became Minokichi's wife, and they later had ten light-skinned children. The children grew older, but she did not seem to age. One evening years later, Minokichi watched Yuki sewing at home. A lamp lit her face softly while their children slept.",
      "text_sha256": "cbd37ef31d6346cbe59ec73148385ca3af637d771d5410ee2d7c672659663432",
      "word_count": 121,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [
        "soft_max_exceeded(word_count=121, soft_max_words=120)"
      ],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "minokichi",
      "speaker": "minokichi",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:minokichi",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"Once, I saw a woman who looked much like you,\"",
      "text_sha256": "e110e434a0e251ffea57fcb78c17a9519696cc36ff1ed540ec64f8f792e75920",
      "word_count": 10,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "Minokichi said.",
      "text_sha256": "d84752bdb1f2e7804d4ca0df37598087239c1632546daf61842007162de83f78",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "text": "\"Where was that?\"",
      "text_sha256": "64de74617b6a9231ef128f34744beff0bf17922fd5d4fd9b63c61788c1d487a5",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10,
        11,
        12
      ],
      "text": "his wife asked him. He told Yuki everything about that night in the hut. He described his master's death, the woman's white breath, and her warning. Yuki dropped her sewing, got up, and bent down over Minokichi.",
      "text_sha256": "dc91954b898a1a7d84fb8a1525fb3d24ad8b360eef0aed041a8f894ee9babe49",
      "word_count": 37,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "\"That woman was me!\"",
      "text_sha256": "574fb78c04c90d4bbc69573e50740e694bde97f1c1d301b8edfb28601c2d6b7c",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "Yuki cried.",
      "text_sha256": "3bc4d586c39c7c02462623238f760ff22d8747f66080281400f113b888c657e6",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c7",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "yuki",
      "speaker": "yuki",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:yuki",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "\"I warned you that I would kill you for telling anyone! Only our sleeping children keep you alive now. You must look after them very well. If they ever have reason to complain about you, you will get what you deserve!\"",
      "text_sha256": "dea9d1973368ca1e1fc5e5960459835b44b93a5ac82d743515089d34147db083",
      "word_count": 41,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/yuki_onna/run_yo_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c8",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "text": "Her voice grew weak, like the sound of crying wind. She melted into white mist and rose towards the roof beams. Then she slipped away through the smoke-hole in the roof. No one ever saw Yuki after that.",
      "text_sha256": "fc3a8bbdd01df1d3a3f1a73c3ee62de5cf10282200c0633735001962347d1367",
      "word_count": 38,
      "split_reason": "article_end(直前の分割点から続く同一Voice区間)",
